## What We Are Not Building Right Now
Auto execution, day trader features, real-time data. We prove the signals are accurate first, then we talk about acting on them.

---

## Order of Execution

```
Week 1-2:   Track 1 (1.1 → 1.2 → 1.3 → 1.4)
Week 3:     Track 2 (begins once Track 1 has data flowing)
Week 3-4:   Track 3 + Track 4 in parallel
Week 5:     Track 2.3 (accuracy on landing page, once sample size is sufficient)
Week 5:     Track 4.4 (weekly digest, once Track 1 performance data exists)
```

